  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-16 text-center sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:py-24">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-300"><i class="ph-fill ph-git-branch" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{t "Open source"}}</span>
    <h2 class="mt-3 font-heading text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">{{t "Built in the open, on Ghost"}}</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-muted">{{t "The whole platform — a custom Ghost theme, the courses, the docs — is an open-source project. Read the code, fix a typo, write a lesson or improve the help center: every contribution ships."}}</p>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="https://github.com/imswarnil/Namaste-Salesforce" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill bg-brand-500 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-brand transition hover:bg-brand-600">{{> "icons/github" class="h-4 w-4"}}{{t "Star on GitHub"}}</a>
      <a href="/docs/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition hover:border-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600"><i class="ph ph-book-open-text" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{t "Docs & help center"}}</a>
      <a href="/become-author/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold transition hover:border-brand-500 hover:text-brand-600">{{> "icons/user-plus" class="h-4 w-4"}}{{t "Contribute content"}}</a>
      <a href="/sponsor/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-pill border border-border bg-surface px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-pink-600 transition hover:border-pink-500"><i class="ph-fill ph-heart" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{t "Sponsor"}}</a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-7 text-sm text-muted">{{t "Powered by"}} <a href="https://ghost.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-semibold hover:text-brand-600">Ghost</a> · {{t "Styled with"}} <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="font-semibold hover:text-brand-600">Tailwind CSS</a> · {{t "MIT-licensed theme"}}</p>
  </div>
</section>

